, 866], [354, 897], [133, 900]]}, {"text": "18,250 × 1,000 =Rs 18,250,000", "conf": 0.783, "box": [[461, 871], [829, 871], [829, 897], [461, 897]]}, {"text": "Key Fact", "conf": 0.803, "box": [[155, 1008], [262, 1008], [262, 1040], [155, 1040]]}, {"text": " When we multiply.a whole number by 10, we put one zero to the right", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[104, 1060], [854, 1063], [854, 1093], [104, 1090]]}, {"text": "of the number.", "conf": 0.859, "box": [[109, 1092], [262, 1094], [262, 1118], [109, 1116]]}, {"text": ": When we multiply a whole number by 100, we put two zeros to the", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[85, 1116], [822, 1120], [822, 1153], [85, 1149]]}, {"text": "right of the number.", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[107, 1147], [315, 1150], [314, 1177], [107, 1174]]}, {"text": "When we multiply a whole number by 1,000, we put three zeros to the", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[103, 1174], [862, 1179], [861, 1212], [103, 1207]]}, {"text": "right of the number.", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[103, 1203], [315, 1207], [314, 1237], [103, 1233]]}, {"text": "OT-FORSALE", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[35, 1322], [173, 1322], [173, 1349], [35, 1349]]}, {"text": "11", "conf": 0.661, "box": [[441, 1326], [469, 1326], [469, 1354], [441, 1354]]}, {"text": "downloaded from awazeingilab.com", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[186, 1476], [755, 1472], [755, 1505], [186, 1509]]}]}